ative expenses were $1.3 million during the three months ended June 30, 2026, compared to $0.8 million for the three months ended June 30, 2025. The increase was primarily attributable to the inclusion of Legacy Decoy's operations in the current quarter following the Merger, which closed in November 2025."}],"ocf":[{"heading":"Operating Activities","text":"Net cash used in operating activities was $5.5 million in the current period, an increase of approximately $3.5 million from the same period in 2025. The increase is primarily due to higher operating expenses during the current period compared to the same period in 2025, including research and development associated with the development of the IMP 3 ACT Platform, professional costs associated with our Special Meeting of Shareholders in February 2026 and current period payments to lower accrued expense balances."}],"net sales":[{"heading":"Grant Revenue","text":"Grant revenue, which was derived solely from the Gates' Foundation grant, was $0.2 million and $0 million during the three months ended June 30, 2026 and 2025, respectively. The increase in revenue was due to an increase in overall expenses allowed by the grant. Given the nature of the development process, grant revenue will fluctuate depending on the stage of development and the timing of expenses."}]},"capex_src":null,"src":{"revenue":{"c":"us-gaap:Revenues","l":"Revenues","ytd":false,"how":"xbrl"},"rd":{"c":"us-gaap:ResearchAndDevelopmentExpense","l":"Research and Development Expense","ytd":false,"how":"xbrl"},"ga":{"c":"us-gaap:GeneralAndAdministrativeExpense","l":"General and Administrative Expense","ytd":false,"how":"xbrl"},"opex_total":{"c":"us-gaap:OperatingExpenses","l":"Operating Expenses","ytd":false,"how":"xbrl"},"oi":{"c":"us-gaap:OperatingIncomeLoss","l":"Operating Income (Loss)","ytd":false,"how":"xbrl"},"ni":{"c":"us-gaap:NetIncomeLoss","l":"Net Income (Loss) Attributable to Parent","ytd":false,"how":"xbrl"},"ocf":{"c":"us-gaap:NetCashProvid